    "body": "Before eae193e750235e4023b3e6313284eede2cd7a022, Connect() only started the connection and returned true. If tor wasn't running the refusal was reported later and only logged under -debug=tor. Since eae193e750 (in v32), every failed reconnect attempt logs:\r\n\r\n```\r\n2026-11-04T14:14:08Z connect() to 127.0.0.1:9051 failed after wait: Connection refused (111)\r\n2026-11-04T14:14:08Z [warning] tor: Error connecting to address 127.0.0.1:9051\r\n2026-11-04T14:14:08Z [warning] tor: Initiating connection to Tor control port 127.0.0.1:9051 failed\r\n```\r\n\r\nOn a default configured node without tor, this pollutes debug.log with 18 lines every hour.\r\n\r\nThis move these warnings back to debug. ",
